---------------------------------------------------------------------------

[0] About CHARMM52 Development

     At the 2026 CHARMM developers meeting we decided to release CHARMM
c52a1 incorporating enhancements and fixes from the development versions
c51a1 and c51a2.

The c52a1 release includes the enhancements and fixes to the development
version c51a2 during the period of August 15, 2025 through August 15, 2026.

==============================================================================

[1] c52a1 Change Log

     At the 2026 CHARMM developers meeting we decided to release CHARMM
c51b1 incorporating enhancements and fixes from the developmental c51a1
and c51a2 versions into the stable version.

The c52a1 release includes the following enhancements and fixes from the
developmental versions c51a1 and c51a2 during the development period of
August 15, 2025 through August 15, 2026. A selection of these have been
added to the stable version c50b2 to create the stable version c51b1.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1.1 February 2026 update to the C36 force field and CGenFF
    Developer: Justin Lemkul
    Institution: Virginia Tech
    Date: 18 February 2026

Merge request: https://charmm-dev.org:1976/bucknerj/dev-release/-/merge_requests/305
Git commit: 176ff720

Description:
Updates the C36 force field and adds the general force field version 5.0 as the default while keeping version 4.6 available for compatibility.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1.2 Corrections to perturbation automatic mode and slow growth free energy
