    Institution: University of Vienna
    Date: 20 February 2026

Merge request: https://charmm-dev.org:1976/bucknerj/dev-release/-/merge_requests/306
Git commit: fa6367a4

Description:
Repairs the perturbation automatic mode and the slow growth free energy calculation, both broken by earlier changes.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------

